{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_045_01_c",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:b2f1f3f41f4d2eb4461df2eee070c04e87888b366af55f864682e91cd7e0d662",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_01_1_2_045_01:1_2_045_01_c:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ef385f856f57310e3f834a7dc33e2f1112aad05d1ec2203d1dca55a99a6e676",
      "text": "话虽如此，离开老家\n一个人上大学，应该会有很多辛苦的事吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_01_1_2_045_01:1_2_045_01_c:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:00be4aad5d7f0b1c4cb53177b17f737b45e5462597457e192b2841e6c7e13c96",
      "text": "嗯——，有些人可能会觉得辛苦吧，\n但我因为是跟哥哥一起住的嘛～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_01_1_2_045_01:1_2_045_01_c:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b55a62bdcdb6b002f924a30e026427ed03f1ca0a45f84b38c2146f42cb75395e",
      "text": "和哥哥在一起的话，\n能让他教我做饭和打扫，很方便哦～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_01_1_2_045_01:1_2_045_01_c:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8be8d7ff499a3b0445590d84d082cab47728c1ae8afbea17c77f4182ad3f31a3",
      "text": "虽说那边是个大忙人，\n基本上都是我在被随意差遣就是了～？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_01_1_2_045_01:1_2_045_01_c:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c162068856962de934d705afba6ca87a81ad26405b560013c1f54dda884c81ac",
      "text": "但是，能向哥哥请教\n那些生活技巧，真的很不错呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_01_1_2_045_01:1_2_045_01_c:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cd6b117885cd8e97bb5b077a2ffceb7cc4fd7c5ec8c930be53635cdae95f290b",
      "text": "是吧是吧。两个人一起住还能省房租，\n身体不舒服的时候也能互相照应……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_01_1_2_045_01:1_2_045_01_c:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:32dbc4227389fb1e4ef65802f19e0b96319c2aa89326490c13822d78edf1cae5",
      "text": "这样的话，就算离开老家也没问题了对吧～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_01_1_2_045_01:1_2_045_01_c:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b6b65997febe869ce0dd3435d794a9bd5b2f812adb66faf592d556ddc07d8f7d",
      "text": "（……话说，当时也是这么跟那两个人解释的呢～）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_01_1_2_045_01:1_2_045_01_c:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3c170b17d20eb86fae3d21bb4008406e6fc45744be2e5467b358042274eebac1",
      "text": "（考大学的时候，想着这是逃离讨厌的老家的好机会，\n挖空心思编了各种各样的借口呢……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_01_1_2_045_01:1_2_045_01_c:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:322735b12d1321303f6e76ef67ae5733a1cabf292995af008bd0cb3691e69918",
      "text": "（“您真的很重视父母呢”，吗～）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_01_1_2_045_01:1_2_045_01_c:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b6bb5ff3d7bea8173a1de615412221faad477355de0f120e819e8ad7052a7813",
      "text": "（明明只是装成那样，实际上，\n不过是在任性地贯彻自己的想法而已呢～……）",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
